{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 47, :comments ["<b>And one who lies in the house.</b> It is severe; therefore it requires washing of garments and immersion, for all that requires washing of garments requires immersion. But to be impure until evening need not be stated, for every eater and one who lies enters the house, and concerning it יטמא עד הערב is said."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:12:16.870963599Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}